  "fullDescription": "This digital planner provides an easy way for you to track and organize your routines and tasks to achieve maximum productivity.\n\n✔︎ Fully hyperlinked to make navigation buttery smooth.\n✔︎ Lifestyle, Wellness, Health & Fitness, Productivity, & Finance sections are aslo included.\n✔︎ Daily, weekly, and monthly Planning Pages.\n✔︎ Monday and Sunday start.\n✔︎ 5 Custom notes pages with hyperlinked tabs.\n✔︎ 6 Notes Paper Template.\n✔︎ Index page hyperlinked to all lifestyle planning pages.\n✔︎ 563 Pages.\n✔︎ Portrait Mode.\n✔︎ Boho, modern, chic & stylish design.\n✔︎ All pages can be easily duplicated and/or removed\n\nRemember you are worthy. Invest in you!\n\n𝗪𝗛𝗔𝗧’𝗦 𝗜𝗡𝗖𝗟𝗨𝗗𝗘𝗗?\n✔︎ Full-Year Digital Planner\n✔︎ Monthly Planner(12 Months)\n✔︎ Weekly Planner(52 Weeks)\n✔︎ Daily Planner(365 Days)\n✔︎ Sunday and Monday Start\n\nYEAR AT A GLANCE\n✔︎ Calendar\n✔︎ Important Dates\n✔︎ Yearly Reflection\n✔︎ Quarter 1\n✔︎ Quarter 2\n✔︎ Quarter 3\n✔︎ Quarter 4\n\nLIFESTYLE\n✔︎ Meal Ideas\n✔︎ Meal Planner\n✔︎ Outfit Planner\n✔︎ Reading Journal\n\nWELLNESS\n✔︎ Wheel of life\n✔︎ Sleep Tracker\n✔︎ Mood Tracker\n\nPRODUCTIVITY\n✔︎ Goal planner\n✔︎ 30 Days Challenge\n✔︎ Mind map\n✔︎ Password log\n\nHEALTH & FITNESS\n✔︎ Water Tracker\n✔︎ Period Tracker\n✔︎ Self-Care Goals\n✔︎ Medication Tracker\n✔︎ Workout Log\n\nFINANCE\n✔︎ Yearly finance\n✔︎ Monthly budget planner\n✔︎ Spending Tracker\n✔︎ 30-day savings challenge\n✔︎ 52 Weeks savings challenge\n\nDASHBOARD\n✔︎ MONTHLY GOALS ( Jan to Dec: 12 Months)\n✔︎ MONTHLY VISION BOARD ( Jan to Dec: 12 Months)\n✔︎ MONTHLY HEALTHY HABITS( Jan to Dec: 12 Months)\n✔︎ MONTHLY REFLECTION ( Jan to Dec: 12 Months)\n\nNOTES\n✔︎ Blank\n✔︎ Lined\n✔︎ Checklist\n✔︎ Dotted\n✔︎ Half grid\n✔︎ Grid\n\nHOW TO DOWNLOAD IT?\nFiles are not emailed to you. For your convenience, they are available for download directly on Creativefabrica. On the My Profile, go to You > My Downloads > Click the button “Download Files”.\n\nDownloading and Unzipping from Creative Fabrica\nClick the green download button next to the file you want.\nThe file will download as a .zip file.\nRight-click the .zip file on your computer.\nSelect “Extract All” (Windows) or “Open With > Archive Utility” (Mac).\nChoose a folder and click “Extract” or “Unzip”.\n\nHOW TO USE IT?\n—Download your digital files on your device.\nImport to GoodNotes or any Annotation app\n\nIf you have any further questions, please do not hesitate to contact me.\nThank you for choosing us!",
